### Debugging on Ingress

1. Check whether the default HTTP backend exists

Run:
```
kubectl get svc default-http-backend -n kube-system -o yaml
kubectl get endpoints default-http-backend -n kube-system
kubectl get pods -n kube-system | grep http
```


2. Check whether the missing NEG exists in Google Cloud

```
gcloud compute network-endpoint-groups list \
  --project=weather-project-prod-511603 \
  --filter="name:k8s1-c1bd0ffd-kube-system-default-http-backend-80-7739e04a"
```

3. Check the cluster events

```
kubectl get events -n kube-system \
  --sort-by=.lastTimestamp
```